{"id":583103,"title":"[Immersive Vehicles] R.A.G.E - Best supercars, buses and cars to drive!","summary":" A pack that will add different cars to your Minecraft","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/B63cKVVf/r-a-g-e-curseforge.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"507\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/853rB02J/warning-message.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch1\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#e03e2d\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstall Official Content Pack and Immersive Vehicles\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:\u0026amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/kG4SN3Nh/about.png\" width=\"900\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003eThis pack adds a large number of cars, discs, wheels. Each car can be disassembled and tuned. In this pack there are more than 20 vehicles in which you can change a lot of parts, each vehicle contains many colours, has working lights and interior lighting\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:left\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:18px\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/TwkL3N8r/r-a-g-e-faq.png\" width=\"900\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:24px\"\u003e👨\u0026zwj;💻\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"\u003eWhy cars are small compared to \u003cem\u003e*insert other pack name*\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:24px\"\u003e🕵️\u0026zwj;♂️\u003c/span\u003eMy cars are made in 1:1 size to the world, unlike most packs which are made in Steve:1 size, but you can resize car in config. Just change\u0026nbsp;\"packVehicleScales\" to 1.2 for all R.A.G.E categories\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:24px\"\u003e👨\u0026zwj;💻\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#f00\"\u003eWhen 1.2X.X or other newer versions?\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#f00\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#000\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:24px\"\u003e🕵️\u0026zwj;♂️\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#f00\"\u003eNothing\u003c/span\u003e depends on me, because R.A.G.E is just a pack for Immersive Vehicles,\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch1\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:\u0026amp;#x27\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/hPmjktGs/r-a-g-e-links.png\" width=\"900\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://discord.gg/pheMFzcAwE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDiscord Server\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@immersive_vehicles_rage\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:\u0026amp;#x27\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:14px\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"\u003eR.A.G.E YouTube Channel\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca